BeDecorator from Haiku (as in Renku OS's source tree, github.com/RenkuOS/Source,
commit 4799bb5a188c, src/add-ons/decorators). MIT licence, Copyright Haiku, Inc.;
see the notices in each file.

Haiku ships it in its haiku_extras package; Renku's repositories don't offer
that, so Power Theme builds it for the Dano theme.

One change: its base class is TabDecorator rather than SATDecorator, as for
FlatDecorator, because SATDecorator's headers aren't among those bundled or
fetched for building. Two includes that aren't needed are gone, and the
Stack & Tile highlight's value is defined in the source.
